# Pox Plague in a game of three. Bot3's Bloodthirsty Conqueror gains Bot3 the life each opponent loses. Every player loses
# half their life, then Bot2 is asked which cards to discard and concedes. Bot2 had already lost 10 life when it left
# (CR 104.3a), so the Conqueror triggered for it too: Bot3 gains 10 for Bot1 and 10 for Bot2.
